--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of the DeepSeek balance handling in this project were modelled on two
MIT-licensed projects. No code was copied verbatim; the normalization rules and
response shapes were reimplemented in Swift.

  * DeepSeek-Reasonix — https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix
    Referenced: internal/billing/balance.go (currency normalization, symbol
    selection, "never convert or cross-add wallet currencies" rule).

  * DeepSeekMonitor — https://github.com/JayHome137/DeepSeekMonitor
    Referenced: the existence and request shape of GET /v1/usage, and the
    read-back-after-write Keychain storage pattern.

